eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995380/extras/52a4e60c3b9231aaaf0b52b218d46254.mp4?t=1685261956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GREED IS GOOD</h2>The only thing that matters is <strong>profit </strong>- you're an <strong>entrepreneur </strong>after all! The money made from your humans can be re-invested in your spaceship, unlocking cruel new technologies to further enhance your humans. When your humans are of no further use to you, you can <strong>grind them down into goo</strong> for a tidy profit.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995380/extras/d020296269c6bebb202d53af7505e5cf.poster.avif?t=1685261956\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995380/extras/d020296269c6bebb202d53af7505e5cf.webm?t=1685261956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995380/extras/d020296269c6bebb202d53af7505e5cf.mp4?t=1685261956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GET RICH FROM HUMAN MISERY</h2>Prepare to get rich with features, such as:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Deep RPG gameplay with a range of humans to abduct to create the ultimate team.<br></li><li>Rivals to crush in the arena - who you can mock and shame afterwards. Or be nice to them, I guess.<br></li><li>Leveling, equipment, organs, skill trees - make your humans powerful!<br></li><li>Character customization - add your friends into the game and watch them die!<br></li><li>Base building, upgrades, characters to talk to and quests to complete!</li></ul>",
